  },
  "card_fields": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "硬节点",
      "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR05\n\n**EVIDENCE-INTERFACES｜**\n- T2/DRAFT-LABEL：`狱神庙慰宝玉`；\n- V5：`茜雪至狱神庙方呈正文`、`红玉茜雪一大回文字`、`红玉后有宝玉大得力处`；\n- **W2已裁：`狱庙相逢` = OPEN-W2 / NO-ACTIVE-INSERTION。92明确不加巧姐/刘姥姥。**/R30/R31/R32；H01/H02；O02开放具体法律接口。必须是真实羁押/待质，不是地牢传奇。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          772,
          779
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          30851,
          31264
        ],
        "text_sha256": "747f3dded7f17758329dc18f6add30897c7b5175d8bbaafa7a3dc93209b1f75b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "最强处 / P-Lock",
      "text": "**2｜最强处 / P-Lock**  \n等候、冷茶、湿鞋泥、粗瓷碗、萝卜、毡、饭钱规则；宝玉先学“不能换碗”；小红先问规则；茜雪只管冷不冷、送袜；最后回窄巷；现有“正是”二句为81—100唯一作者韵化收束。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          780,
          782
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          31264,
          31534
        ],
        "text_sha256": "af0a58a3a34bbfed6c415bc3ee97a025838f0bad479a929041e0afe1efad5649"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "最薄处",
      "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n“为什么留质—问什么—范围如何变窄—为什么放”需要司法链更清楚；小红“大得力”必须具体而非万能。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          783,
          785
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          31534,
          31700
        ],
        "text_sha256": "c04613526fd337f964446697d4e207ceaaadf2335cc01f8654cbb2c1d9c081bf"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n92-S1认单≠定罪；S2第一次留质家里不知多久；S3第一夜规则学习；S4小红办能不能送；S5茜雪办保暖；S6第二轮问讯使范围缩小；正常释放。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          786,
          788
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          31700,
          31908
        ],
        "text_sha256": "4e9955259a25cacca5651767990721298088a9e0a8ab597e8a6de8d12f908d41"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n狱卒、书办、同监、小红、茜雪、贾芸。每人各做一件，不组成“营救小队”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          789,
          791
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          31908,
          32032
        ],
        "text_sha256": "41a30df75a701738f517eb6131617c994db5502e03255ab72a22f17db29ed8de"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n38禁补；粗歌若有也不必。宗教只许狱神日常微仪式。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          792,
          794
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          32032,
          32122
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d04bf41f68c9501dcc1051d2b002387123fb9913f9c2a024dcac3f86ddda2163"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \n无人物诗。作者韵文只保留现有：\n“门里十日，只知饭冷灯昏；门外一程，才觉人间路窄。”\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          795,
          798
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          32122,
          32271
        ],
        "text_sha256": "fd06c6797c1d1fc992b71c98caf02a88caa2030abb12c7f15497e1210b286e26"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "name": "笑料",
      "text": "**8｜笑料**  \n同监关于饭、鞋、规矩的小话可保；不能喜剧化司法威胁。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          799,
          801
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          32271,
          32368
        ],
        "text_sha256": "053200c1498097e00af82bfbf2f69beb66c0f7774ce0a5c6d613d473ae587ed3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "宗教/梦",
      "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n41-P：狱神一盏灯、烟熏顶棚。若增，只加小役剪灯花/添油，老囚随手合掌而另一个人不理。绝不显灵、许愿获释。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          802,
          804
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          32368,
          32543
        ],
        "text_sha256": "505e136dc042e1ca76f88589f7a3e758d90aa234abba76b692a1548d9583299d"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n本回职业密度最高：狱卒关心班次/规矩，书办关心记录一致，同监关心饭和毡，小红先搞清制度。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          805,
          807
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          32543,
          32693
        ],
        "text_sha256": "691f1024a95d253812f2620688e641beb554b5e454142152b155e0e99a7bd18a"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "name": "四链",
      "text": "**11｜四链**  \n钱：钱只能改善饭、跑腿、送物，不能买结案。物：厚袜、粗饭、毡、包裹。信：家里最初只知“留一留”，信息延迟是痛点。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          808,
          810
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          32693,
          32881
        ],
        "text_sha256": "5142c870dc1c08deab17bed386e12efd04fd25facc0a6f149133cdf67cc9acf7"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "必须保留",
      "text": "**12｜必须保留**  \n萝卜、鞋袜、毡、碗受控；小红问规则；茜雪厚袜；狱神灯；不劫狱。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          811,
          813
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          32881,
          33000
        ],
        "text_sha256": "8596aa8683a9192f0c6b028d9c727daa9e9a27f73ce19de3ecf82cab5c08c62b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n酷刑、屈打成招、大反派、权贵搭救、神迹翻案；“男丁连坐”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          814,
          816
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          33000,
          33107
        ],
        "text_sha256": "993cf13ed67f3f2e9aebcca285d5bf370934ee2e4425c9fd83a70b10d548b615"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3",
      "text": "**14｜L3**  \n必须L3重构为程序与日常交叉，是压力测试。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          817,
          819
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          33107,
          33182
        ],
        "text_sha256": "2e507dde7b9c4d38635ecef53c0db5d1fdb38b74c4d2d55a053bb434f34163e9"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "name": "前80同构",
      "text": "**15｜前80同构**  \n61“判冤决狱”展示内部管理与证据细节；92扩展到国家司法但仍写人怎么过一天。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          820,
          822
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          33182,
          33316
        ],
        "text_sha256": "2d4a5a779d4954ed06907174b9c5ba8a6b7c96288784dec7c0050fccc13bdb8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "name": "回前诗",
      "text": "**16｜回前诗** 无。  \n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          823,
          823
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          33316,
          33344
        ],
        "text_sha256": "e1c22a397f53f3d123997c31bccf5dc898e2eee9267dc54c723ff51c44ba4ad3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "name": "回末诗",
      "text": "**17｜回末诗** 保留唯一“正是”二句。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          824,
          825
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          33344,
          33398
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ffc3ad1a8d1707c48dd47831124bf457876ba23fa6ff9b2a7dd6b092677d4fe1"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "name": "章法 / 风险",
      "text": "**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n传问等候 → 留质突然发生 → 第一夜规则 → 家中信息断裂 → 小红制度性帮助 → 茜雪旧情保暖 → 第二轮问讯 → 范围收窄 → 正常释放 → 饭香/窄门。  \n**压力测试问题：**是否既有法律可信度又仍是小说；小红帮助是否“大得力”但不传奇；宗教是否真实存在却完全不救案。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          826,
          829
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          33398,
          33795
        ],
        "text_sha256": "fb8033734c34167c334c5c15e4ff3e09d2a92e4fc9451811424991f81a7d1565"
      }
    }
  ],
